OL,3,GNEWSAMultimillion-pound boost to
OL,4,Aimprove patient records
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS trust in Cambridgeshire is set
OL,7,Fto receive up to #18m for a new
OL,8,Felectronic patient record (EPR) system
OL,9,Ffor its hospitals.
OL,11,FEPR systems create a single digital
OL,12,Frecord for each patient, allowing
OL,13,Fdoctors and healthcare professionals to
OL,14,Faccess information such as medical
OL,15,Fhistories and test results quickly.
OL,17,FHannah Coffey, chief executive officer
OL,18,Fof North West Anglia NHS Foundation
OL,19,FTrust, said the funding was a
OL,20,F"significant milestone" for the
OL,21,Forganisation's digital transformation
OL,22,Fprogramme.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
