OL,3,GNEWSAMultimillion-pound boost to
OL,4,Aimprove patient records
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust, which runs Peterborough
OL,7,FCity, Hinchingbrooke, and Stamford and
OL,8,FRutland hospitals, said the new system,
OL,9,Ffunded by NHS England, would help
OL,10,Fimprove patient experience.
